# Architect: Hans Bihs
# Regression: cylinder-on-cone bag (Strand et al. 2013 cage, model scale), coarse grid
# flexible bag with mobility sharp: filling 0.98 pumped out of the bag interior over 0.2 s (drain), staggered coupling
# with added mass, bending hinges, smoothed fluid geometry; hydrograph inflow (B 60 2)
membrane cylcone 1 1.2 0.38 0.9 1.2 1.53
name strand2013
resistance 1.0e5 0
projections 1
print 0
structure flexible
mass 1.0
density 1140
stiffness 5.0e5
damping 0.1
compression 0.001
filling 0.98
drain 0.2
mobility sharp
